WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.010
Every answer mentioned Levoit.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.570
But only two comparisons ranked it first.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.890
In RecoScope’s November 20 humidifier snapshot,

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.290
we captured 12 usable answers

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.270
across four AI assistants and three prompt types.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.070
Levoit appeared in all 12 answers.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.810
Carepod appeared in six.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.970
Yet first place split evenly.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.550
Claude and Gemini ranked Levoit first.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:25.850
ChatGPT and Perplexity ranked Carepod first.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:30.590
Levoit and Dreo also appeared in all four under-$100 answers.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.350
Mentions don’t verify checkout prices,

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.270
room fit, or safety claims.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:40.290
On November 13, first place split between Carepod, Levoit and Dreo.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:42.690
Today, it split between two brands.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.870
These are dated snapshots, not a controlled trend.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.550
Track mentions and comparative rank separately.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.270
These findings describe captured answers,

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:52.630
not product quality.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:55.570
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
